@ProposalApp.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:5018

### Register a new user
POST {{ProposalApp.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Buyer"
}

### Login
POST {{ProposalApp.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login - wrong password (should return 401)
POST {{ProposalApp.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Register duplicate email (should return 400)
POST {{ProposalApp.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Buyer"
}